      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The experimental data about the strain of intervertebral discs and vertebral bodies under physiologic loads are described; the relation between tissue strain, mechanically induced damage and clinical symptoms in the region of the lumbar spine is discussed. With reference to a paper by Kirkaldy-Willis and Farfan on \"Instability of the Spine\" a new representation of the interrelation between mechanical factors, pathologic changes and psychic influences in the development of low back pain is given."},
